    "security_layers": [
      "Layer 1: X-Client-Secret untuk semua mobile API calls",
      "Layer 2: X-App-Version enforcement (mencegah app versi lama)",
      "Layer 3: JWT auth untuk protected endpoints",
      "Layer 4: X-API-TOKEN untuk integrasi eksternal",
      "Layer 5: Role-based scoping (CheckRole middleware - role 5 vs 6)",
      "Layer 6: OPD-based data scoping (master_opd_id pada queries)"
    ],
    "performance_optimizations": [
      "Redis caching (predis)",
      "Database indexes pada revenues & targets (migration 2026_04_01)",
      "Optimized revenues table structure (migration 2026_04_02)",
      "Separated lightweight dashboard endpoints (/summary, /retribusi-breakdown, dll) untuk mengganti single heavy endpoint",
      "AJAX cascade dropdowns (lokasi-by-opd, rincian-by-retribusi, sub-rincian-by-rincian) untuk form retribution-target"
    ],
    "potential_issues": [
      "Lint warnings: View [admin.transactions.draft|active|paid|...] not found - karena routes pakai prefix yang sama dengan show() method (Laravel mengira admin.transactions.{referenceNo} = admin.transactions.draft), tetapi tidak masalah karena methods tersebut return JSON (AJAX), bukan view",
      "Kernel.php belum register CheckRole middleware alias (saat ini hanya client.secret, app.version, api.token)",
      "Banyak master data CRUD diakses dari 2 controller (API MasterDataController dan Web/Master*Controller) - potensi duplikasi logic"
    ]
